{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34024","headline":"寄怀南阳润卿 · 皮日休","name":"寄怀南阳润卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹿门山下捕鱼郎，今向江南作渴羌。\n无事只陪看藕样，有钱唯欲买湖光。\n醉来浑忘移花处，病起空闻焙药香。\n何事对君犹有媿，一篷冲雪返华阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}